{"url": "https://wiki.idlecorp.xyz/api.php?format=json&formatversion=2&action=parse&page=Voting&prop=text%7Clinks%7Cimages%7Ctemplates%7Ccategories&redirects=1", "retrievedAt": "2026-10-09T14:55:19.267457+00:00", "body": "{\"parse\":{\"title\":\"Voting\",\"pageid\":35,\"redirects\":[],\"text\":\"<div class=\\\"mw-parser-output\\\"><p>Voting for the IdleCorp bot will allow more potentially new players to see the bot on Discord bot listing sites. At the time of writing, IdleCorp is only listed on Top.GG (Discord Bots List): <a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\\\" class=\\\"external free\\\" href=\\\"https://top.gg/bot/601241235474350122\\\">https://top.gg/bot/601241235474350122</a>\\n</p>\\n<div id=\\\"toc\\\" class=\\\"toc\\\"><input type=\\\"checkbox\\\" role=\\\"button\\\" id=\\\"toctogglecheckbox\\\" class=\\\"toctogglecheckbox\\\" style=\\\"display:none\\\" /><div class=\\\"toctitle\\\" lang=\\\"en\\\" dir=\\\"ltr\\\"><h2>Contents</h2><span class=\\\"toctogglespan\\\"><label class=\\\"toctogglelabel\\\" for=\\\"toctogglecheckbox\\\"></label></span></div>\\n<ul>\\n<li class=\\\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\\\"><a href=\\\"#Voter.27s_Boon\\\"><span class=\\\"tocnumber\\\">1</span> <span class=\\\"toctext\\\">Voter's Boon</span></a></li>\\n<li class=\\\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\\\"><a href=\\\"#Gratitude_Points\\\"><span class=\\\"tocnumber\\\">2</span> <span class=\\\"toctext\\\">Gratitude Points</span></a>\\n<ul>\\n<li class=\\\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\\\"><a href=\\\"#Corporation_name\\\"><span class=\\\"tocnumber\\\">2.1</span> <span class=\\\"toctext\\\">Corporation name</span></a></li>\\n<li class=\\\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\\\"><a href=\\\"#Corporation_motto\\\"><span class=\\\"tocnumber\\\">2.2</span> <span class=\\\"toctext\\\">Corporation motto</span></a></li>\\n<li class=\\\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\\\"><a href=\\\"#Research\\\"><span class=\\\"tocnumber\\\">2.3</span> <span class=\\\"toctext\\\">Research</span></a></li>\\n</ul>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n</div>\\n\\n<h2><span id=\\\"Voter's_Boon\\\"></span><span class=\\\"mw-headline\\\" id=\\\"Voter.27s_Boon\\\">Voter's Boon</span><span class=\\\"mw-editsection\\\"><span class=\\\"mw-editsection-bracket\\\">[</span><a href=\\\"/index.php?title=Voting&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\\\" title=\\\"Edit section: Voter&#039;s Boon\\\">edit</a><span class=\\\"mw-editsection-bracket\\\">]</span></span></h2>\\n<p>As a reward for voting, corporations with voter's boon active will receive 25% faster production rates across all <a href=\\\"/index.php/Category:Facility\\\" title=\\\"Category:Facility\\\">facilities</a>, as well as a 10% increase on the hourly buy limit. Each vote also grants 1x gratitude point, $1,000.00, and 200 <a href=\\\"/index.php/Season_pass\\\" title=\\\"Season pass\\\">Pass XP</a>.\\n</p>\\n<h2><span class=\\\"mw-headline\\\" id=\\\"Gratitude_Points\\\">Gratitude Points</span><span class=\\\"mw-editsection\\\"><span class=\\\"mw-editsection-bracket\\\">[</span><a href=\\\"/index.php?title=Voting&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\\\" title=\\\"Edit section: Gratitude Points\\\">edit</a><span class=\\\"mw-editsection-bracket\\\">]</span></span></h2>\\n<p>Gratitude points are a reward for voting and are global across all regions. Gratitude points can currently be spent on changing your corporation's name or motto, or for instantly completing research, the latter being the only thing that helps your corporation in a non-cosmetic way.\\n</p>\\n<h3><span class=\\\"mw-headline\\\" id=\\\"Corporation_name\\\">Corporation name</span><span class=\\\"mw-editsection\\\"><span class=\\\"mw-editsection-bracket\\\">[</span><a href=\\\"/index.php?title=Voting&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\\\" title=\\\"Edit section: Corporation name\\\">edit</a><span class=\\\"mw-editsection-bracket\\\">]</span></span></h3>\\n<p>A corporation's name can be changed by spending 2x gratitude points with the following command: <code>$$name &lt;name&gt;</code>\\n</p><p>For example, changing a corporation's name to \\\"My Corporation\\\": <code>$$name My Corporation</code>\\n</p>\\n<h3><span class=\\\"mw-headline\\\" id=\\\"Corporation_motto\\\">Corporation motto</span><span class=\\\"mw-editsection\\\"><span class=\\\"mw-editsection-bracket\\\">[</span><a href=\\\"/index.php?title=Voting&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\\\" title=\\\"Edit section: Corporation motto\\\">edit</a><span class=\\\"mw-editsection-bracket\\\">]</span></span></h3>\\n<p>A corporation's motto can be changed by spending 1x gratitude points with the following command: <code>$$motto &lt;motto&gt;</code>\\n</p><p>For example, changing a corporation's name to \\\"Hello World\\\": <code>$$motto Hello World</code>\\n</p>\\n<h3><span class=\\\"mw-headline\\\" id=\\\"Research\\\">Research</span><span class=\\\"mw-editsection\\\"><span class=\\\"mw-editsection-bracket\\\">[</span><a href=\\\"/index.php?title=Voting&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\\\" title=\\\"Edit section: Research\\\">edit</a><span class=\\\"mw-editsection-bracket\\\">]</span></span></h3>\\n<p>A corporation can choose to expedite its research by spending 4x gratitude points with the following command: <code>$$res</code> and clicking the checkmark that appears.\\n</p>\\n<!-- \\nNewPP limit report\\nCached time: 20261008180552\\nCache expiry: 86400\\nDynamic content: false\\nComplications: []\\nCPU time usage: 0.004 seconds\\nReal time usage: 0.004 seconds\\nPreprocessor visited node count: 17/1000000\\nPreprocessor generated node count: 0/1000000\\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\\nHighest expansion depth: 2/40\\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\\n-->\\n<!--\\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\\n-->\\n\\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key icwiki:pcache:idhash:35-0!canonical and timestamp 20261008180552 and revision id 1516\\n -->\\n</div>\",\"categories\":[],\"links\":[{\"ns\":0,\"title\":\"Season pass\",\"exists\":true},{\"ns\":14,\"title\":\"Category:Facility\",\"exists\":true}],\"templates\":[],\"images\":[]}}"}